  "body": "### What is the issue with the Web IDL Standard?\n\nThis continues from https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/1423#issuecomment-2258993403.\n\nThe following specifications may need to be updated, per webdex:\n\n- [x] DOM\n  - whatwg/dom#1301\n- [x] HTML\n  - whatwg/html#10543\n- [x] Notifications\n  - whatwg/notifications#216\n- [x] Streams\n  - whatwg/streams#1320\n- [x] Files and Directories\n  - WICG/entries-api#43\n- [x] Prioritized Task Scheduling\n  - WICG/scheduling-apis#102\n- [x] Shared Storage\n  - WICG/shared-storage#169\n- [x] Video rVFC\n  - WICG/video-rvfc#90\n- [x] Web Smart Card\n- [x] CSS Layout API\n  - w3c/css-houdini-drafts#1127\n- [x] CSS Paint API\n  - w3c/css-houdini-drafts#1127\n- [x] CSS View Transitions\n- [x] Geolocation\n  - w3c/geolocation#172\n- [x] Reporting API\n  - w3c/reporting#270\n- [x] Web Locks\n- [x] WebXR\n  - immersive-web/webxr#1380",
